{"id":"n57689-1-8","stage":2,"title":"밥솥 · 饭锅","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57689-1-8-1","ko":"집에 밥은 있니?","zh":"家里有饭吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"밥은","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥은","audio":"/audio/9bd554d2a3fa2bf7a1e1.mp3"}},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있니","audio":"/audio/5cc802647eea2944ec84.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/54049819ba7816b0e5d6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57689-1-8-2","ko":"밥솥을 열어 봐야 알 것 같아.","zh":"看来得打开电饭煲看看才知道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥솥을","meaning":"饭锅","explanation":"밥솥：饭锅；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥솥","audio":"/audio/5c73f1cc4996286312e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57689","senseId":"1","lemma":